            is built on the open-source projects below, and this page gives their license texts, as
            those licenses ask. The source code of LRC Open Player is at
            <a href="https://github.com/Myron4iktop/lrc-open-player">github.com/Myron4iktop/lrc-open-player</a>.</p>

